WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:08.260
Dear Diary,
Today was the day — my first day at my new school! 

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.600
Come on, we need a pic!
A selfie or something.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.420
It was so exciting, I don’t even know where to start!

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.260
First of all, it’s a lot fancier than my old school. 

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.120
The pool is bigger than the school!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.860
It’s an elite academy, and my classmates are the sons and daughters

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.500
of some of the most important people in the country! 

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.720
I'm doing my best to be an idol!

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.480
I hear your family runs
a successful toy company.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.240
They do.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.500
Just think about it:

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.100
I’m surrounded by 
future politicians and business leaders.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.080
When your name is Nadia Shanaa,

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.600
you'd better be informed of
what can get you expelled.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.960
Just in case.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.340
The entire school is so beautiful, like a university campus,

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.700
and we all wear these super stylish uniforms.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.780
It’s like something out of a fairy tale.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:01.620
To be honest,
I was a bit nervous about going to school here. 

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.120
What's up, people? I'm Christian.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.120
Look at this guy.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:09.020
There were some rumors about how they
 treat transfer students. 

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:12.080
Okay, according to you,

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.320
you're saying it's the new students that are at fault?

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:20.100
When a different species is introduced into an ecosystem,
it disrupts it.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.580
But so far, everyone’s been nice! 

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.600
Take home the win!

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:25.800
Score!

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:28.420
I even hung out with them after school.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.400
Hey, would you like to come to a party
at my place tomorrow night?

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.200
Maybe you'd like to do a little
gambling with me?

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:36.900
It doesn’t seem like anything could go wrong!

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.540
I'm going to step down as president,

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.800
and we'll arrange an election to choose another one.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:45.740
Dear Diary,

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:48.980
I’ve been at my new school for a week now, and,

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:53.100
well, let’s just say there have been a couple of hiccups.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.080
No, that's just...

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:01.220
I mean, for one thing, my classmates
have some really complicated relationships!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:05.140
 It’s hard to keep up with who’s dating who, who owes who what,

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.420
and who’s where on the pecking order.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:08.680
Mittens!

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:15.500
I feel like I’m spending more time studying
the social structure than I am on my classwork!

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.000
This should be a ten.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.780
And some of the stuff going on is pretty intense! 

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.320
If I can't pay back what I owe,
I'll truly become a house pet.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:33.660
Over the past week, I’ve realized there’s
a lot of drama going on behind the scenes.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:35.820
Gambling... 

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.260
Theft...

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:40.780
Drugs...

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.240
What about the police?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.880
We're just three innocent students.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:45.940
Sex...

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.460
Violence...

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.360
-Don't!
-Stop!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:52.560
Get the fuck out of my school!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.140
Everyone seemed so nice and well-adjusted at first,

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.740
 but it turns out being rich doesn’t solve all your problems.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.560
What the hell is this?

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:07.700
In fact, it seems to create quite a few.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:11.760
I don't have a price tag.
And trust me, if I did, you couldn't afford it.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.720
This is a massacre.
I've already surrendered three billion yen.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.280
My status as a student council member...
destroyed!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.280
I cannot allow that to happen!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.900
One more thing, diary:

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.780
I’m feeling a lot of pressure from my classmates to act like them, 

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:30.980
and get involved in some pretty dangerous stuff.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.600
We need to get rid of that blood. Come here.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.940
I want to fit in, but I don’t want to change who I am…

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.340
What should I do?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.440
If it must be.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.400
I wager my life in return.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.020
Dear Diary,

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:52.620
After a lot of soul searching, I’ve finally decided.
It seems so obvious now.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.820
Why should I hold back? Why resist?

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:59.300
Why deny myself the opportunity I’ve found here?

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:03.020
I’m not just going to embrace the high-stakes lifestyle.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.980
I’m going to rise to the top!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:14.080
They thought they could bully me.
Now, they're freaking out.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Drugs, crime, gambling.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:20.860
I’ll do anything to show the world who’s best! 

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.700
To earn my classmates’ respect—no, fear!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.180
To become... an elite!

